# Reciprocal Crosses


=== layout: one-panel

# Reciprocal Crosses

@body

- Pea plants are sexual organisms
- A cross can be preformed in two ways\:
  - Male round x Female wrinkled
  - Male wrinkled x Female round
- Outcome of cross did not depend on which trait was in the male vs. the female\:

