=== layout: two-panels

# Chromosome nomenclature

@left

- [*A*]{underline=true}: one set of autosomes.
- [*AA, AAA, AAAA*]{underline=true}: two, three, or four autosome sets.
- A typical XX fruit fly has 8 chromosomes: 2, 2, 3, 3, 4, 4, X, X.
- XX:AAA has 11 chromosomes: three copies each of chromosomes 2, 3, and 4, plus two X chromosomes.

@right

![Chromosome nomenclature](assets/lect06e-x_linked_genes_2/autosome_set_nomenclature.svg)

